	(text "Matrix: the PIO watches the 8 strobes of CPU J1 (open collector, pulled up on the CPU board) and, for the active strobe,\npulls the returns of the closed switches to ground (2N7002), within 2 us; the CPU board waits about 125 us per strobe.\nDedicated: 24 x 2N7002 to ground on CPU J2, J3, J13 (switch closed = drain on). TAMPIN (J2 pin 12) left open.\n74HCT595 at 5 V (3.3 V inputs are fine for HCT). SR_OE_N is pulled high and every gate has 100 k to ground: all switches\nopen until the firmware has loaded the registers and pulled SR_OE_N low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6feb9c8d-0636-5393-ab95-2dfc81770a6b")
	)
	(text "CPU board connectors"
